  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Is the workload evidence sufficient for a decision?",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.8312627986348127,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "Enterprise DNA organizes eighteen attributes across six dimensions:",
      "start": 2.8312627986348127,
      "end": 7.276040955631401,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "business, technology, dependencies, economics, data and risk, and target state.",
      "start": 7.276040955631401,
      "end": 12.573242320819114,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "Inspect the values and verification status.",
      "start": 12.573242320819114,
      "end": 15.199010238907851,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Relationship views support context, while missing and incomplete fields show where",
      "start": 15.199010238907851,
      "end": 19.51440273037543,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "further investigation is needed.",
      "start": 19.51440273037543,
      "end": 20.97569965870307,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "The deterministic readiness gate requires at least seventy percent completeness and zero",
      "start": 20.97569965870307,
      "end": 25.298703071672357,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "critical gaps. Confidence, completeness, and readiness are different signals.",
      "start": 25.298703071672357,
      "end": 29.850034129692833,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "A high confidence score cannot override missing critical evidence.",
      "start": 29.850034129692833,
      "end": 32.803071672354946,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Verify facts using appropriate evidence.",
      "start": 32.803071672354946,
      "end": 35.14723549488055,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Load Sample Evidence is a labeled demo shortcut, not external verification.",
      "start": 35.14723549488055,
      "end": 39.40935153583617,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, carry the workload context into assessment;",
      "start": 39.40935153583617,
      "end": 42.484163822525595,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
